OL,3,GNEWSATelegrams from Hollywood stars go
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA collection of telegrams sent by
OL,7,FHollywood film stars to celebrate the
OL,8,Fopening of a Doncaster cinema in the
OL,9,F1960s are going up for auction.
OL,11,FThe messages were sent by actors
OL,12,Fincluding Omar Sharif, Julie Christie,
OL,13,FRoger Moore and Bette Davis for ABC
OL,14,FDoncaster's gala evening on 18 May
OL,15,F1967, which also included a screening
OL,16,Fof Doctor Zhivago.
OL,18,FThe telegrams were kept by manager Len
OL,19,FKey and were recently discovered by his
OL,20,Fdaughter Lesley Huyton, from
OL,21,FScunthorpe, when she was clearing out
OL,22,Fher parents' house.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
